40/extras/c40c9aab12d85f547e12518a9fc2716e.poster.avif?t=1761069857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/c40c9aab12d85f547e12518a9fc2716e.webm?t=1761069857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/c40c9aab12d85f547e12518a9fc2716e.mp4?t=1761069857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create buildings to produce more resources and upgrade your cities to allocate more buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/55360cf8d0ef80f9c0a0ba716a361f7d.poster.avif?t=1761069857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/55360cf8d0ef80f9c0a0ba716a361f7d.webm?t=1761069857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/55360cf8d0ef80f9c0a0ba716a361f7d.mp4?t=1761069857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your enemies in battle and conquer their settlements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/4036b81e9a4e52985995d5c5f6ddf065.poster.avif?t=1761069857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/4036b81e9a4e52985995d5c5f6ddf065.webm?t=1761069857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/4036b81e9a4e